"Sussu enchanted the Grave of All Giants."
"Sussu's personal items are inert for anyone else, and antimagic cannot undo that."
"Long ago Ogarius implanted enchantments in Esebus citizens set to turn them into monsters."
"Kalis also made self-replicating constructs, city-killing enchantments and doomsday spells."
"Later, the Heirs loot Sussu's vault of about thirty doomsday artifacts."
"The vault held a clockwork orb that alters the fundament and weapons of rainbow-hued glass."
"Later, Aarl's bottomless pouch copies simple enchantments such as ammunition."
"Later, Aarl's shape-changing club grows to absurd size as he swings it."
"Later, a Kalis wizard-staff of silvery cubes improves and duplicates Stella's spells."
"Later, Colborn flies on enchanted bracelets and owns a pocket house."
"A disabled enchanted listening paper turns from pale gold to beige as its magic dies."
"Years later, message tablets are a new invention that cannot reach past the northern peaks."
"Years later, Giantsrest trades enchanted items for Gemore's manufactured goods."
